# Staged wallet assets are COPIES of pinned npm packages
# (sdn-js/node_modules/hd-wallet-wasm + hd-wallet-ui), regenerated by
# ../stage-wallet-wasm.sh. They are build INPUT for deployment/docker/Dockerfile
# (COPY into /app/wallet-wasm and /app/wallet-ui), never edited by hand and
# never committed. The two directories themselves ARE tracked, via .gitkeep, so
# a plain `docker build` still succeeds on a tree that has not been staged yet —
# the node fails open and simply reports sign-in unavailable.
*
!.gitignore
!wallet-wasm/
!wallet-ui/
wallet-wasm/*
wallet-ui/*
!wallet-wasm/.gitkeep
!wallet-ui/.gitkeep
